<div class="component-demo">
  <h3>◉ Avatar & Stack</h3>
  <p class="text-muted mb-4">
    Composants pour représenter des utilisateurs ou des entités. Supporte les images (avec recadrage automatique) et le texte, ainsi que l'empilement (Stack).
  </p>

  <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      <div class="box box-secondary h-100 mb-0">
        <h5 class="mb-4">Tailles & Fallbacks</h5>
        
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="avatar avatar-sm">
            <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=1" alt="Avatar SM">
          </div>
          <div class="avatar">
            <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=2" alt="Avatar MD">
          </div>
          <div class="avatar avatar-lg">
            <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=3" alt="Avatar LG">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-4">
          <div class="avatar bg-primary-subtle text-primary-dark">
            JD
          </div>
          <div class="avatar bg-warning-subtle text-warning-dark">
            <i class="ri-star-smile-line"></i>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      <div class="box box-secondary h-100 mb-0">
        <h5 class="mb-4">Avatar Stack (Chevauchement)</h5>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-4">L'effet de chevauchement se fait nativement via des marges négatives. Les avatars se soulèvent au survol.</p>

        <div class="avatar-stack mb-4">
          <div class="avatar"><img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=4" alt="User"></div>
          <div class="avatar"><img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=5" alt="User"></div>
          <div class="avatar"><img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=6" alt="User"></div>
          <div class="avatar bg-secondary-subtle text-secondary-dark">+3</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <h5>Code d'exemple</h5>
    {% set codeExample %}
<div class="avatar avatar-lg">
  <img src="avatar.jpg" alt="Jane Doe">
</div>

<div class="avatar bg-primary-subtle text-primary-dark">
  JD
</div>

<div class="avatar-stack">
  <div class="avatar"><img src="user1.jpg" alt="User 1"></div>
  <div class="avatar"><img src="user2.jpg" alt="User 2"></div>
  <div class="avatar bg-surface-hover text-muted">+5</div>
</div>
    {% endset %}
    {% include 'fragments/components/_code-block.html.twig' with {
      'code': codeExample,
      'language': 'html',
      'title': 'Structure HTML Avatars'
    } %}
  </div>
</div>